se%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23dfebf5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8919f164%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"eb5e395f\" id=\"eb5e395f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udd50ee43\" id=\"udd50ee43\">场景与痛点</span></strong></h4><ul list=\"u24cd9abb\"><li fid=\"u504581e5\" data-lake-id=\"ue2b7d141\" id=\"ue2b7d141\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u45cabdc7\" id=\"u45cabdc7\">业务需求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7f7fd4f1\" id=\"u7f7fd4f1\">：三甲医院在线问诊平台需7×24小时实时响应患者提问（日均请求量50万+），要求回答准确率&gt;92%，响应时延&lt;500ms。</span></li><li fid=\"u504581e5\" data-lake-id=\"u79466e29\" id=\"u79466e29\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u22e739be\" id=\"u22e739be\">原有方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udb8cc899\" id=\"udb8cc899\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u24cd9abb\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf63f89d5\" data-lake-id=\"u1d066b14\" id=\"u1d066b14\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46a6aea7\" id=\"u46a6aea7\">使用175B参数的GPT-3.5生成答案，准确率95%但单次推理需3.2s（超标6倍）。</span></li><li fid=\"uf63f89d5\" data-lake-id=\"uaa0b7bd2\" id=\"uaa0b7bd2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f14b698\" id=\"u2f14b698\">尝试直接部署7B小模型（如LLaMA），准确率骤降至78%。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u24cd9abb\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u504581e5\" data-lake-id=\"ue364f4c2\" id=\"ue364f4c2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufef09517\" id=\"ufef09517\">核心矛盾</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue35f9125\" id=\"ue35f9125\">：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue566c206\" id=\"ue566c206\">大模型精度高但时延超标，小模型速度快但知识欠缺</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u82d5f90e\" id=\"u82d5f90e\">。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"f99dfb90\" id=\"f99dfb90\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ude767fe6\" id=\"ude767fe6\">蒸馏方案设计</span></strong></h4><ol list=\"u4c7d87fa\"><li fid=\"u487dc532\" data-lake-id=\"uf67a5062\" id=\"uf67a5062\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e77741c\" id=\"u7e77741c\">教师模型选型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28a14b00\" id=\"u28a14b00\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ua464aa88\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u251396df\" data-lake-id=\"uf155b15f\" id=\"uf155b15f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d72ea46\" id=\"u1d72ea46\">冻结GPT-3.5作为教师模型，聚焦医疗垂直领域微调（100万条医患对话+医学文献）。</span></li><li fid=\"u251396df\" data-lake-id=\"u540b3cca\" id=\"u540b3cca\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucb41745e\" id=\"ucb41745e\">创新点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3e06ec33\" id=\"u3e06ec33\">：引入症状-药品关联性矩阵，强化疾病与治疗方案的逻辑推理能力。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u4c7d87fa\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u487dc532\" data-lake-id=\"u99e314c4\" id=\"u99e314c4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u490b0d80\" id=\"u490b0d80\">学生模型架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue2f27057\" id=\"ue2f27057\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u3b223e4e\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u020ff188\" data-lake-id=\"u2a5f899d\" id=\"u2a5f899d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaaa593f5\" id=\"uaaa593f5\">选用DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B蒸馏模型，通过三步迁移： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BC%AA%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%9A%E8%92%B8%E9%A6%8F%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%20%20%5Cnteacher_logits%20%3D%20GPT3.5(medical_texts%2C%20temperature%3D2.0)%20%20%23%20%E8%BD%AF%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87%20%20%5Cnstudent_logits%20%3D%20DeepSeekR1(medical_texts)%20%20%5Cn%23%20%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%3DKL%E6%95%A3%E5%BA%A6(%E6%95%99%E5%B8%88logits%2F%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9Flogits)%20%2B%200.3*%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%20%20%5Cnloss%20%3D%20KLDiv(teacher_logits%2C%20student_logits)%20%2B%200.3%20*%20CrossEntropy(labels%2C%20student_logits)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%